<script setup lang="ts">import {ref} from 'vue'; import {productRules,adTypeRules} from '../api/mock'; const tab=ref<'product'|'adtype'>('product')</script><template><section class="page"><div class="page-head"><div><h1>规则管理</h1><p>产品归属与广告类型是两套独立规则。</p></div></div><div class="card panel"><div class="type-tabs"><button class="tab" :class="{active:tab==='product'}" @click="tab='product'">Campaign 产品归属规则</button><button class="tab" :class="{active:tab==='adtype'}" @click="tab='adtype'">Campaign 广告类型映射</button></div><div class="table-wrap" v-if="tab==='product'"><table><thead><tr><th>Campaign ID</th><th>名称</th><th>分配方式</th><th>产品范围</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in productRules" :key="r.campaign"><td>{{r.campaign}}</td><td>{{r.name}}</td><td><code>{{r.method}}</code></td><td>{{r.scope}}</td><td>{{r.status}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-wrap" v-else><table><thead><tr><th>Campaign ID</th><th>名称</th><th>一级</th><th>二级</th><th>来源</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in adTypeRules" :key="r.campaign"><td>{{r.campaign}}</td><td>{{r.name}}</td><td>{{r.l1}}</td><td><code>{{r.l2}}</code></td><td>{{r.source}}</td><td>{{r.status}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section></template>
